      "filePath": "elephant_gripper/elephant_gripper/runtime/fake_serial.py",
      "summary": "在内存中模拟 gripper 串口设备请求/响应的脚本化 stand-in，仅实现 serial.Serial 被 GripperSerialLink 使用到的子集，使 runtime 与 supervisor 可在无硬件条件下被测试。",
      "tags": [
        "test-double",
        "serial",
        "hardware-simulation",
        "gripper"
      ],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "通过 frame_codec 解析请求帧并构造响应帧，复用真实协议编解码路径以保证测试逼真度。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:elephant_gripper/elephant_gripper/runtime/gripper_supervisor.py",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "gripper_supervisor.py",
      "filePath": "elephant_gripper/elephant_gripper/runtime/gripper_supervisor.py",
      "summary": "协调左右两个 gripper link、permit 状态与急停（estop）的核心调度器；仅做 O(1) 决策与快照，所有串口 I/O 委托给 link 工作线程，且不导入任何 ROS 依赖。",
      "tags": [
        "service",
        "orchestrator",
        "permit-gating",
        "estop",
        "gripper"
      ],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "通过 threading.Lock 保护 permit 状态，default-deny 语义：未收到 permit 前所有命令都被丢弃。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:elephant_gripper/elephant_gripper/service/permit_gate.py",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "permit_gate.py",
      "filePath": "elephant_gripper/elephant_gripper/service/permit_gate.py",
      "summary": "命令放行判定的唯一真相源（pure function，无 ROS 依赖）：仅在 permit 存在、allowed=True 且未超过 timeout 时返回 True，体现 default-deny 安全语义。",
      "tags": [
        "permit-gating",
        "validation",
        "pure-function",
        "safety"
      ],
      "complexity": "simple",
      "languageNotes": "时钟回退（future stamp）被钳制为 0，避免因单调时钟异常误判过期。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:elephant_gripper/elephant_gripper/types/command_permit.py",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "command_permit.py",
      "filePath": "elephant_gripper/elephant_gripper/types/command_permit.py",
      "summary": "服务层使用的本地（RAM）CommandPermit 不可变 dataclass，刻意与 ROS act_interfaces/CommandPermit 消息解耦，使 service 层无需导入 ROS 即可推理 permit。",
      "tags": [
        "data-model",
        "type-definition",
        "permit",
        "dataclass"
      ],
      "complexity": "simple",
      "languageNotes": "frozen dataclass + classmethod denied() 提供 default-deny 工厂，维护 allowed 与 reason_code 的互斥不变式。"
    },
    {
